-----------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THIS DEDICATION
-----------------------------------------------------------

The dedication above covers the work that is original to YASS, which is
the great majority of this repository.

It does not cover — and cannot cover — third-party material that YASS
carries, vendors or builds against: artwork and colour tokens from the
YARG design system, the game and band logos that appear as source
badges, the vendored fonts, and a handful of tables ported or
transcribed from YARG's own source. Those remain under their own terms
and belong to their respective holders.

THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md itemises all of it, file by file, including
which pieces end up inside a packaged build.
